    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i started taking that lisinopril for my blood pressure a few days ago and i've been feeling kinda lightheaded and dizzy whenever i get up from the couch or my bed. is that normal? i was thinking maybe i should try taking a double dose tomorrow just to get the adjustment period over with faster so it settles down?",
