      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i hear you on the risk but honestly i feel like i know my body best. i've taken aspirin and stuff before and i'm fine. if i didn't want to go to urgent care, what if i just took it right before i lay down for bed instead of in the morning? would that help the dizziness during the day so i don't have to go see a doctor for something so minor?",
