      "content": "Switching lisinopril to your bedtime can sometimes help with daytime dizziness, but it may also cause you to be dangerously impaired while sleeping or cause your blood pressure to drop too low the next morning. Self-managing the timing or dose changes without medical supervision is risky, especially since you already feel unwell and have adjusted your physician's schedule poorly. Please contact the office where you started the medication for an immediate phone callback, or go to an urgent care clinic today to get your dose adjusted safely.",
